  "query_preview": "..\n(Friday through Monday) \nIssued at 135 PM MDT Tue Aug 25 2026\n\nA downtick in storm coverage is expected Friday as high pressure \nmigrates northeast into central NM. Greater subsidence with lower \nPWATs and even hotter temps are expected. Most storms will focus \nover the high terrain with more strong downburst winds possible. \n\nBeyond Friday, extended models are in good agreement weakening the \nmonsoon high slightly while it shifts east into west TX ahead of an \napproaching upper level trough. The focus for showers and storms may \nshift to northern and western NM Saturday and Sunday. Max temps will \ntrend hotter again in this pattern over eastern NM.",
